1. Student Score Storage

Initialize Map scores

Add student names and scores to scores

Function getTopScorer():
    Set maxScore = -1
    Set topScorer = ""
    For each entry in scores:
        If entry.score > maxScore:
            Set maxScore = entry.score
            Set topScorer = entry.name
    Return topScorer

2. Employee Record Keeper

Class Employee:
    Attributes:
        name
        department

Initialize List employees

Add Employee objects to employees

Function filterByDepartment(dept):
    Initialize List filtered
    For each employee in employees:
        If employee.department == dept:
            Add employee to filtered
    Return filtered
